<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 14,000 T of raw sugar -Trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 14,000 T of raw sugar -Trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought a cargo of 14,000 tonnes raw sugar at $276.90 per tonne C&amp;F at a snap tender on Wednesday, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Shipment was for September 15/30. The tender was launched by refiner Societe Tunisienne du Sucre. --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
